1
00:00:00,113 --> 00:00:05,558
A glacial lake above Hunza bursts and takes the Karakoram Highway bridge with it.

2
00:00:06,019 --> 00:00:10,294
Pakistan tracks one hundred and thirty-one potentially dangerous lakes.

3
00:00:10,642 --> 00:00:11,974
But on many summer days,

4
00:00:12,094 --> 00:00:13,181
cloud hides them.

5
00:00:13,566 --> 00:00:15,747
NISAR's radar sees straight through.

6
00:00:16,245 --> 00:00:18,445
SARtale watches eleven lakes.

7
00:00:18,717 --> 00:00:21,238
It turns dark radar pixels into water,

8
00:00:21,566 --> 00:00:24,200
tracks each lake pass after pass,

9
00:00:24,377 --> 00:00:27,275
and flags only changes bigger than its own noise.

10
00:00:27,642 --> 00:00:31,917
Anyone can put forward a new lake and see how often NISAR passes over it.

11
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,823
SARtale: when clouds close in,

12
00:00:34,981 --> 00:00:36,483
the lakes stay in view.
